@smalltailqwq/dsh-client-ui-skin-internet-angel-desktop README · Development：Source code is in `src/`; installation artifacts are in `lib/`. Original assets live in `assets/source/` and are registered in `assets/art.manifest.json`; `pnpm build` first copies them by content hash into `assets/runtime/`, which the skin's node half serves instead of inlining them into JavaScript. Keep build artifacts, runtime assets and the build fingerprint in sync after changes.
Tests are in `tests/`; builds and unit tests do not replace visual and interaction checks on real devices.
Reproducible bug reports and narrowly scoped improvements to the skin itself are welcome.

